rvational, analytical and the application of other skills. Also there are many interesting features including numerous puzzles and a \u201cmicro world\u201d experience. Through this, players can genuine and fun experience that can only be had in virtual reality.", "short_description": "TTORiNG Adventure is a voice recognition based interactive animation. The story progresses through the user directly engaging in conversations with characters in an imaginary world. Consequently, there is a high level of immersion and the player can actively participate in the story. Also there are many interesting features including numerous puzzles and a \u201cmicro world\u201d experience. Through this, players can genuine and fun experience that can only be had in virtual reality."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.vrotein.co.kr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.vrotein.co.kr/", "publisher_name": "VRotein", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.vrotein.co.kr/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "PUZZLE", "EDUCATIONAL", "CASUAL", "EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "367350161453016"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "297687690696324"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "334259943642807"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "334259943642807"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1497718800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "297687690696324"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes":